{"sha": "8d3786af7671cd86b101c5272531e070dd9310668867033308f466b2f8144809", "body": ["\\section{正交}", "", "\\begin{definition}[正交向量]\\label{def:g11:scal:orthogonal}", "若两个向量 \\emph{正交}\\index{正交向量}，记作", "$\\vec u \\perp \\vec v$，若 $\\vec u \\cdot \\vec v = 0$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "对非零向量，由\\cref{thm:g11:scal:faces}的公式 2", "可知 $\\vec u \\cdot \\vec v = 0 \\iff \\cos\\theta = 0 \\iff$ 两向量的方向", "垂直。零向量与任何向量都正交。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{example}", "$\\vec u\\,(3, 2)$ 与 $\\vec v\\,(-4, 6)$：$\\vec u \\cdot \\vec v = -12 + 12 =", "0$：两向量正交。一般地，$\\vec u\\,(a, b)$ 总与", "$\\vec v\\,(-b, a)$ 正交 --- 即一次四分之一周的旋转。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{余弦定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[余弦定理]\\label{thm:g11:scal:cosines}", "\\index{余弦定理}", "在三角形 $ABC$ 中，三边 $a = BC$、$b = CA$、$c = AB$，", "角 $\\widehat A$ 位于顶点 $A$ 处：", "\\[", "a^2 = b^2 + c^2 - 2bc\\,\\cos\\widehat A .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "记 $\\vect{BC} = \\vect{BA} + \\vect{AC} = \\vect{AC} - \\vect{AB}$，并", "利用\\cref{prop:g11:scal:rules}展开：", "\\[", "a^2 = \\norm{\\vect{BC}}^2", "= \\norm{\\vect{AC}}^2 - 2\\,\\vect{AC}\\cdot\\vect{AB} + \\norm{\\vect{AB}}^2", "= b^2 + c^2 - 2\\,\\vect{AB}\\cdot\\vect{AC}.", "\\]", "由余弦公式，", "$\\vect{AB}\\cdot\\vect{AC} = c\\,b\\,\\cos\\widehat A$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "当 $\\widehat A$ 为直角时，$\\cos\\widehat A = 0$，余弦定理", "退化为勾股定理 $a^2 = b^2 + c^2$：它是", "毕达哥拉斯定理加上非直角情形的修正项。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.15]", "  \\coordinate (A) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (4,0);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (1.2,2.2);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (A) -- (B) -- (C) -- cycle;", "  \\node[below left, font=\\small] at (A) {$A$};", "  \\node[below right, font=\\small] at (B) {$B$};", "  \\node[above, font=\\small] at (C) {$C$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2,0) {$c$};", "  \\node[above left, font=\\small] at (0.6,1.1) {$b$};", "  \\node[above right, font=\\small] at (2.6,1.1) {$a$};", "  \\draw[->,omThm,thin] (0.7,0) arc (0:61.4:0.7);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (30:1.0) {$\\widehat A$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 余弦定理：已知两边 $b$、$c$ 及其夹角，", "即可确定第三边 $a$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g11:scal:cosines}", "某三角形两边长分别为 $b = 5$、$c = 8$，它们的夹角", "$\\widehat A = \\frac\\pi3$。则", "\\[", "a^2 = 25 + 64 - 2 \\times 5 \\times 8 \\times \\frac12 = 89 - 40 = 49,", "\\]", "于是 $a = 7$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{应用：圆与垂线}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[以已知线段为直径的圆]\\label{prop:g11:scal:diameter}", "点 $M$ 位于以 $[AB]$ 为直径的圆上，当且仅当", "\\[", "\\vect{MA} \\cdot \\vect{MB} = 0 .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "若 $M \\neq A, B$，该条件说明 $M$ 处的角，", "在三角形 $AMB$ 中为直角，而对线段张直角的点", "恰为以该线段为直径的圆上的点。下面给出直接证明：", "设 $O$ 为 $[AB]$ 的中点，$r = \\frac{AB}{2}$。则", "$\\vect{MA} = \\vect{MO} + \\vect{OA}$，且", "$\\vect{MB} = \\vect{MO} + \\vect{OB} = \\vect{MO} - \\vect{OA}$，故", "\\[", "\\vect{MA}\\cdot\\vect{MB}", "= \\norm{\\vect{MO}}^2 - \\norm{\\vect{OA}}^2 = MO^2 - r^2,", "\\]", "该式恰在 $MO = r$ 时为零，即 $M$ 位于以 $O$ 为圆心、", "$r$ 为半径的圆上。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[直线的法向量]\\label{prop:g11:scal:normal}", "向量 $\\vec n\\,(a, b)$ 与直线", "$d : ax + by + c = 0$ 的每一个方向向量都正交；称 $\\vec n$ 为 $d$ 的 \\emph{法向量}", "\\index{法向量}。两直线垂直，当且仅当", "它们的法向量（或方向向量）正交。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$d$ 的一个方向向量为 $\\vec u\\,(-b, a)$", "（见\\cref{thm:g11:vect:cartesian}），且", "$\\vec n \\cdot \\vec u = a(-b) + b(a) = 0$。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}